WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.397 --> 00:00:15.197
Roxy groaned.

2
00:00:15.818 --> 00:00:19.560
"We're stuck on this robot planet!"

3
00:00:20.501 --> 00:00:21.502
Cozlin looked around.

4
00:00:22.743 --> 00:00:24.564
Broken spaceships lay everywhere.

5
00:00:25.485 --> 00:00:27.206
But none looked like it would still fly.

6
00:00:28.327 --> 00:00:29.127
She looked at Dr.

7
00:00:29.247 --> 00:00:29.768
Odd's moon.

8
00:00:32.472 --> 00:00:33.332
"Do you think Dr.

9
00:00:33.492 --> 00:00:34.913
Odd has something we can use?"

10
00:00:36.194 --> 00:00:37.354
Roxy was confused.

11
00:00:37.374 --> 00:00:41.636
"He won't let us borrow a spaceship, if that's what you're thinking."

12
00:00:43.057 --> 00:00:44.497
"No," Cozlin said.

13
00:00:44.517 --> 00:00:47.698
"But it sounds like we need to arrest him anyway.

14
00:00:48.659 --> 00:00:50.940
Maybe he has a spaceship in that moon."

15
00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:52.941
Roxy sighed.

16
00:00:53.781 --> 00:00:54.741
Cozlin had a point.

17
00:00:56.162 --> 00:00:59.203
Dr. Odd was probably their best chance of getting off this planet.

18
00:01:03.148 --> 00:01:05.190
They flew to the moon and opened a hatch.

19
00:01:09.995 --> 00:01:11.616
Quietly they walked down a hallway.

20
00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:18.643
They arrived at a big door, and Cozlin's device beeped quickly.

21
00:01:18.663 --> 00:01:21.946
"I'm detecting life," Cozlin said.

22
00:01:21.966 --> 00:01:24.789
"Dr. Odd is behind this door."

23
00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:27.872
Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

24
00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:33.303
Whiz-hoo! The door exploded, and the two superheroes burst into the room.

25
00:01:36.044 --> 00:01:37.805
Dr. Odd was drinking a cup of tea.

26
00:01:39.746 --> 00:01:40.707
He held up his hands.

27
00:01:40.727 --> 00:01:44.429
"Stop! Don't destroy anything!"

28
00:01:45.670 --> 00:01:46.730
Roxy was surprised.

29
00:01:47.911 --> 00:01:48.971
She expected him to fight.

30
00:01:48.991 --> 00:01:51.193
"Please," Dr.

31
00:01:51.253 --> 00:01:51.713
Odd said.

32
00:01:51.733 --> 00:01:56.035
"If we fight in here, my computer controls will all get destroyed.

33
00:01:57.168 --> 00:01:59.830
Then none of us will ever leave this planet."

34
00:02:05.833 --> 00:02:07.434
Roxy gave him a suspicious look.

35
00:02:09.055 --> 00:02:10.695
Dr. Odd held up his hands again.

36
00:02:10.716 --> 00:02:13.297
"I'm unarmed.

37
00:02:13.757 --> 00:02:16.198
My big robot is in its charging station.

38
00:02:17.219 --> 00:02:19.160
So please, just listen to me."

39
00:02:20.421 --> 00:02:21.681
Roxy folded her arms.

40
00:02:22.902 --> 00:02:23.903
Cozlin did the same.

41
00:02:23.923 --> 00:02:26.024
"Okay," Roxy said.

42
00:02:26.744 --> 00:02:29.726
"Talk." Dr.

43
00:02:29.826 --> 00:02:30.746
Odd took a deep breath.

44
00:02:30.766 --> 00:02:36.649
"I told you I didn't harm this planet, and I was telling the truth."

45
00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:38.770
He held out his arms.

46
00:02:38.790 --> 00:02:40.371
"This is my moon.

47
00:02:40.912 --> 00:02:45.534
I spent years designing it, and my robots built it while I was in prison.

48
00:02:46.815 --> 00:02:52.038
All I wanted was to travel around the galaxy and explore—by myself.

49
00:02:53.198 --> 00:02:58.428
But then a magnetic force dragged me here, to Groon."

50
00:02:58.448 --> 00:02:59.649
"What happened to Groon?"

51
00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:00.910
Cozlin asked.

52
00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:03.312
"Where are all of its forests?"

53
00:03:04.713 --> 00:03:09.677
"Robots buried all the forests under layers of metal and machinery," Dr.

54
00:03:09.798 --> 00:03:10.318
Odd said.

55
00:03:11.979 --> 00:03:13.200
Roxy narrowed her eyes.

56
00:03:13.901 --> 00:03:15.322
"How do you know that?"

57
00:03:18.324 --> 00:03:19.826
Dr. Odd turned on a computer.

58
00:03:24.049 --> 00:03:27.312
found this computer deep in the planet while exploring one day.

59
00:03:27.844 --> 00:03:28.465
Watch this."

60
00:03:29.765 --> 00:03:32.727
A video showed a small city surrounded by lush forests.

61
00:03:34.268 --> 00:03:36.769
Roxy saw that the aliens in the video looked happy.

62
00:03:36.789 --> 00:03:41.011
"This is a Groonian city," Dr.

63
00:03:41.132 --> 00:03:41.592
Odd said.

64
00:03:42.912 --> 00:03:45.414
Suddenly a dark shadow spread across everything.

65
00:03:46.775 --> 00:03:49.876
The Groonians gazed up toward the sky, looking scared.

66
00:03:50.857 --> 00:03:51.797
Then the video ended.

67
00:03:51.817 --> 00:03:55.739
"That's the only video," Dr.

68
00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:56.300
Odd said.

69
00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:00.902
"But I learned more about Groon's history from computer files.

70
00:04:02.382 --> 00:04:06.184
That shadow you saw was an enormous robot named Meltron.

71
00:04:07.364 --> 00:04:13.007
He makes smaller robots, using scrap metal—spaceships, vehicles, even buildings.

72
00:04:14.487 --> 00:04:18.989
Those robots can make more robots, and Meltron controls all of them.

73
00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:22.571
He sends them out to take over other planets."

74
00:04:24.011 --> 00:04:25.092
Cozlin looked sad.

75
00:04:26.568 --> 00:04:27.348
"Like mine."

76
00:04:27.368 --> 00:04:30.929
"We have to stop the robots!"

77
00:04:31.389 --> 00:04:32.050
Roxy said.

78
00:04:32.070 --> 00:04:34.950
"Before they take over the whole galaxy."

79
00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:38.211
"I know how to do it," Dr.

80
00:04:38.311 --> 00:04:38.811
Odd said.

81
00:04:38.831 --> 00:04:41.152
"But it won't be easy."

82
00:04:42.592 --> 00:04:44.433
Roxy didn't know if she could trust the man.

83
00:04:45.373 --> 00:04:46.774
But she didn't really have a choice.

84
00:04:46.794 --> 00:04:49.774
"How?" she asked.

85
00:04:50.675 --> 00:04:51.395
He looked grim.

86
00:04:51.415 --> 00:04:54.016
"We have to destroy Meltron."
